00:19:32,320 --> 00:19:35,310
UTAGE: Wanting others to be happy 
or wanting them to smile...

471
00:19:35,310 --> 00:19:36,960
UTAGE: It's those feelings.

472
00:19:38,340 --> 00:19:39,810
TAMON: It is?

473
00:19:39,810 --> 00:19:43,170
UTAGE: Um... I don't really understand it 
that well myself, 

474
00:19:43,170 --> 00:19:48,260
UTAGE: but I just hope that's what 
love ends up feeling like for you.

475
00:19:49,510 --> 00:19:50,510
UTAGE: And so...

476
00:19:51,710 --> 00:19:54,220
UTAGE: The fact that you work so hard, 
Gloomyhara-senpai...

477
00:19:54,220 --> 00:19:55,220
UTAGE: is also love!

478
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:00,840
UTAGE: Oh, they've started!

479
00:20:10,650 --> 00:20:11,930
UTAGE: Wow...

480
00:20:16,710 --> 00:20:19,750
UTAGE: Wanting others to be happy 
or wanting them to smile...

481
00:20:19,750 --> 00:20:21,580
UTAGE: It's those feelings.

482
00:20:29,740 --> 00:20:30,930
TAMON: Kino...

483
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:32,700
TAMON: No.

484
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:40,430
TAMON: Thank you, Uta-chan.

485
00:20:41,330 --> 00:20:42,320
UTAGE: Cha—

486
00:20:42,710 --> 00:20:46,660
UTAGE: Not Kinoshita-san 
or even Utage, but "chan"?!

487
00:20:46,660 --> 00:20:48,570
UTAGE: He chose something in between?!

488
00:20:48,570 --> 00:20:49,780
TAMON: Oh...

489
00:20:49,780 --> 00:20:51,570
TAMON: Is what I'm feeling right now love, too?

490
00:20:51,570 --> 00:20:52,630
UTAGE: No, absolutely not.

491
00:20:52,630 --> 00:20:54,820
UTAGE: It's the camaraderie from
 pretending to be friends, 

492
00:20:54,820 --> 00:20:57,450
UTAGE: but not really. 
It's just a fleeting illusion.

493
00:20:57,450 --> 00:21:00,330
TAMON: O-Oh, I see. I'm sorry.

494
00:21:00,330 --> 00:21:01,670
UTAGE: That was close.

495
00:21:01,670 --> 00:21:05,880
UTAGE: Tamon-kun's so earnest that he almost
 had a world-ending misunderstanding.

496
00:21:05,880 --> 00:21:09,230
TAMON: But now I feel like I'll be 
able to win the second round.

497
00:21:09,230 --> 00:21:13,280
UTAGE: That's great. I'll be cheering you on 
as your fan and your housekeeper.

498
00:21:13,280 --> 00:21:14,460
TAMON: I'll do my best.

499
00:21:15,310 --> 00:21:18,600
UTAGE: By the way, what will you be 
doing for the second round?

500
00:21:19,700 --> 00:21:21,770
TAMON: Um...

501
00:21:22,320 --> 00:21:25,070
MC: Who is the F/ACE of F/ACE?

502
00:21:25,610 --> 00:21:28,820
MC: And now, we begin the second round 
of our competition to decide the center!

503
00:21:28,820 --> 00:21:31,650
MC: A complete 180 from our 
first round of visual battles, 

504
00:21:31,650 --> 00:21:34,030
MC: they'll be doing something 
much more physical this time.

505
00:21:34,630 --> 00:21:37,160
MC: Today, they'll literally 
be running on water!

506
00:21:44,620 --> 00:21:46,700
MC: And in first place, 
we have Tamon Fukuhara!

507
00:21:47,120 --> 00:21:51,090
MC: Congratulations! No one could compete 
with your speed and drive!

508
00:21:51,090 --> 00:21:52,370
TAMON: Thank you very much!

509
00:21:52,370 --> 00:21:55,140
TAMON: I ran with my heart filled with 
my love to my girlfriends.

510
00:21:55,140 --> 00:21:57,600
UTAGE: Tamon-kun... 
What happened to finding love?

511
00:21:57,970 --> 00:22:02,440
MC: Could we get a message for all 
the E/YES supporting you out there?

512
00:22:02,440 --> 00:22:04,130
TAMON: Did you guys see that?

513
00:22:04,130 --> 00:22:06,900
TAMON: You'd better be ready to accept my love.

514
00:22:08,610 --> 00:22:10,830
RIKO: It sure must be rough being an idol.

515
00:22:10,830 --> 00:22:14,070
YUINA: Yet we're part of the problem for 
sitting here enjoying their suffering.

516
00:22:14,070 --> 00:22:15,530
UTAGE: Yup, yup.

517
