00:22:27,020 --> 00:22:30,260
LYRICS: Uh huh...

522
00:22:30,260 --> 00:22:32,290
LYRICS: Na na na...

523
00:22:32,290 --> 00:22:35,360
LYRICS: Uh huh...

524
00:22:37,480 --> 00:22:46,910
LYRICS: I wonder what the world 
would look like without you

525
00:22:47,730 --> 00:22:52,620
LYRICS: When I look back, 
you've always been by my side

526
00:22:52,620 --> 00:22:57,520
LYRICS: Teaching me what "warmth" 
and "happiness" feel like

527
00:22:57,520 --> 00:23:00,330
LYRICS: A speedboat sails across the endless skies

528
00:23:00,330 --> 00:23:02,860
LYRICS: An unwavering course, 
a straight shot down the middle

529
00:23:02,860 --> 00:23:05,500
LYRICS: An unbreakable red balloon 
found nowhere else

530
00:23:05,500 --> 00:23:08,750
LYRICS: Is this "fate"? Or just a "coincidence"?

531
00:23:09,030 --> 00:23:13,820
LYRICS: Like a wilted flower coming back to life

532
00:23:13,820 --> 00:23:16,400
LYRICS: A light that shines

533
00:23:16,400 --> 00:23:19,390
LYRICS: Through the impossibly dark night

534
00:23:19,390 --> 00:23:20,700
LYRICS: (Light of your soul)

535
00:23:20,700 --> 00:23:22,050
LYRICS: I wanted to grasp it

536
00:23:22,050 --> 00:23:23,330
LYRICS: (I love you so)

537
00:23:23,330 --> 00:23:24,390
LYRICS: So I strived for it

538
00:23:24,390 --> 00:23:27,120
LYRICS: Wanna keep going, wanna keep growing

539
00:23:27,120 --> 00:23:30,900
LYRICS: Bringing our flowers and dreams 
into full bloom
